<template>
  <div class="guide-page guide-manage"><PageHead title="指南内容维护" desc="只维护解释、步骤与示例，不改变业务规则、路由、权限或内置关联。"><el-button @click="exportBackup">导出指南备份</el-button><el-button type="primary" @click="importOpen=true">导入指南</el-button></PageHead>
    <el-alert v-if="guide.contentError" :title="guide.contentError" type="error" :closable="false"/><el-alert v-if="guide.external" title="其他窗口更新了指南。当前输入保留，请读取最新并核对后再保存。" type="warning" :closable="false"/>
    <div class="guide-toolbar"><el-button @click="readLatest">读取最新，保留当前输入</el-button><el-button v-if="guide.rawContent" @click="download(guide.rawContent,'guide-content-original.txt')">导出原始内容</el-button><span class="guide-muted">内容库修订 {{guide.state.revision}}</span></div>
    <details class="panel guide-coverage"><summary>内容覆盖与待核清单</summary><p>正式页面族 {{guidePages.filter(p=>p.formal).length}}；文章 {{guide.articles.length}}；待核验 {{guide.articles.filter(a=>a.status==='review').length}}；待业务确认 {{guide.articles.filter(a=>a.status==='business-pending').length}}。</p><p>下列检查仅验证引用与结构，不能替代业务核验。精确失败候选登记 {{guideFailureBranches.length}} 个，其中已有实际分支证据 {{testedBranches}} 个；另有 {{guideFailureGaps.length}} 类旧分支待补。</p><ul><li v-for="(issue,i) in references" :key="i">{{issue}}</li><li v-for="gap in guideFailureGaps" :key="gap.id">{{gap.note}}（{{gap.id}}）</li></ul><p v-if="!references.length">当前引用与结构检查未发现问题。</p></details>
    <div class="guide-management-layout"><aside class="panel guide-management-list"><el-input v-model="search" clearable placeholder="搜索维护文章" aria-label="搜索维护文章"/><button v-for="article in filtered" :key="article.id" :aria-current="article.id===selected?'true':undefined" @click="select(article.id)"><strong>{{article.title}}</strong><small>{{guide.state.drafts[article.id]?'有草稿 · ':''}}修订 {{article.revision}} · {{article.status==='verified'?'已核验':article.status==='business-pending'?'待业务确认':'待核验'}}</small></button></aside>
      <section v-if="form" class="panel guide-management-editor"><div class="guide-toolbar"><h2>{{form.title || '编辑说明'}}</h2><el-tag v-if="dirty" size="small" type="warning">有未保存修改</el-tag><el-button :disabled="busy||!guide.state.previous[selected]" @click="restorePrevious">恢复上一发布版</el-button></div><el-alert v-if="error" :title="error" type="error" :closable="false"/><el-alert v-if="!reconciled" title="已读取最新发布版，当前输入保持原样。请比较下方最新摘要并明确核对后继续。" type="warning" :closable="false"/><div v-if="!reconciled" class="guide-review-latest"><p>最新标题：{{guide.article(selected)?.title}}；修订 {{guide.article(selected)?.revision}}</p><p>{{guide.article(selected)?.summary}}</p><el-checkbox v-model="reconciled">已核对最新内容与当前输入</el-checkbox></div>
      <el-form label-position="top" :disabled="busy||!catalog.can('system:guide:update')"><el-form-item label="内置文章 ID"><el-input :model-value="selected" disabled/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="标题" required><el-input v-model="form.title" maxlength="200" aria-label="指南标题"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="摘要" required><el-input v-model="form.summary" type="textarea" :rows="3" maxlength="2000" aria-label="指南摘要"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="章节内容" required><div class="guide-section-editor"><div class="guide-toolbar"><el-select v-model="activeSection" placeholder="选择章节" aria-label="选择编辑章节"><el-option v-for="section in parsedSections" :key="section.id" :value="section.id" :label="section.title"/></el-select><el-button @click="addSection">添加补充章节</el-button><el-button :disabled="!currentSection||currentSection.id==='conditions'" @click="removeSection">删除本章节</el-button><el-checkbox v-model="advanced">高级 JSON</el-checkbox></div><p class="guide-muted">普通编辑可直接修改段落、步骤和示例；真实规则条件保持只读，解释编辑不会改变执行规则。</p><template v-if="!advanced&&currentSection"><el-alert v-if="currentSection.id==='conditions'" title="真实允许／禁止条件为内置依据，只读。可在其他章节补充解释与示例。" type="info" :closable="false"/><el-input :model-value="currentSection.title" :disabled="currentSection.id==='conditions'" aria-label="章节标题" @update:model-value="updateSection('title',$event)"/><label class="guide-field-label">段落（每行一段）</label><el-input :model-value="currentSection.paragraphs?.join('\n')||''" type="textarea" :rows="6" :disabled="currentSection.id==='conditions'" aria-label="章节段落" @update:model-value="updateSection('paragraphs',$event)"/><label class="guide-field-label">操作步骤（每行一步）</label><el-input :model-value="currentSection.steps?.join('\n')||''" type="textarea" :rows="5" :disabled="currentSection.id==='conditions'" aria-label="章节步骤" @update:model-value="updateSection('steps',$event)"/><p v-if="currentSection.table" class="guide-muted">本章节含对照表；需要调整表格时使用高级 JSON。</p></template><el-input v-if="advanced" v-model="sectionsText" type="textarea" :rows="17" class="guide-json" aria-label="章节JSON"/><p v-if="!parsedSections.length" class="issue-error">章节 JSON 结构无效，请在高级 JSON 中修正。输入已保留。</p></div></el-form-item><el-form-item label="适用实现"><el-input v-model="form.implementation" maxlength="500" aria-label="适用实现"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="核验依据（每行一条）"><el-input v-model="evidenceText" type="textarea" :rows="3" aria-label="核验依据"/></el-form-item><el-checkbox v-model="reviewed">已按当前实现核验（发布为已核验需填写依据）</el-checkbox></el-form>
      <p class="guide-muted">保存草稿会转为待核验。普通读者只看到发布版。发布前必须预览这次输入。</p><div class="guide-toolbar"><el-button :loading="busy" :disabled="!canSave" @click="saveDraft">保存草稿</el-button><el-button :disabled="busy" @click="preview">预览当前输入</el-button><el-button type="primary" :loading="busy" :disabled="!canPublish" @click="publish">发布说明</el-button></div><p v-if="!canPublish" class="guide-muted">先保存本次草稿并预览；输入变化后需重新保存和预览。</p></section>
    </div>
    <el-drawer v-model="previewOpen" title="说明预览（尚未发布）" size="min(900px,96vw)" append-to-body><ArticleRenderer v-if="previewArticle" :article="previewArticle" anchor-prefix="preview" maintenance/></el-drawer>
    <el-dialog v-model="importOpen" title="导入指南说明" width="min(800px,96vw)" :close-on-click-modal="false"><p class="guide-muted">只支持指南备份，不接受商品数据、权限或内置执行绑定。预览后明确确认，整批写入。</p><input type="file" accept=".json,.txt" aria-label="选择指南备份文件" @change="readImport"/><el-input v-model="importText" type="textarea" :rows="12" aria-label="指南备份JSON"/><el-alert v-if="importError" :title="importError" type="error" :closable="false"/><p v-if="importPreview" data-guide-import-preview>预览：发布说明 {{importPreview.articles?.length||0}} 篇，草稿 {{importPreview.drafts?.length||0}} 篇；依据内容库修订 {{importPreview.revision}}。</p><template #footer><el-button :disabled="busy" @click="importOpen=false">取消</el-button><el-button :disabled="busy" @click="previewImport">校验并预览</el-button><el-button type="primary" :loading="busy" :disabled="!importPreview||previewImportText!==importText" @click="confirmImport">确认导入</el-button></template></el-dialog>
  </div>
</template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import '../../components/guide/guide.css'
import {computed,ref,watch} from 'vue'
import {useRoute} from 'vue-router'
import {ElMessage,ElMessageBox} from 'element-plus'
import PageHead from '../../components/PageHead.vue'
import ArticleRenderer from '../../components/guide/ArticleRenderer.vue'
import {useRbacDraftGuard} from '../../components/rbac/useRbacDraftGuard'
import {useGuideStore} from '../../stores/guide'
import {useCatalogStore} from '../../stores/catalog'
import {guidePages} from '../../domain/guide/registry'
import {guideFailureBranches,guideFailureGaps} from '../../domain/guide/failureRegistry'
import {guideReferenceProblems,overrideProblems} from '../../domain/guide/validation'
import type {GuideArticle,GuideOverride,GuideSection} from '../../domain/guide/types'
const guide=useGuideStore(),catalog=useCatalogStore(),route=useRoute(),search=ref(''),selected=ref(''),form=ref<GuideOverride>(),sectionsText=ref(''),evidenceText=ref(''),reviewed=ref(false),error=ref(''),busy=ref(false),basis=ref(guide.state.revision),reconciled=ref(true)
const activeSection=ref(''),advanced=ref(false)
const parsedSections=computed<GuideSection[]>(()=>{try{const rows=JSON.parse(sectionsText.value);return Array.isArray(rows)?rows.filter(s=>s&&typeof s.id==='string'&&typeof s.title==='string'):[]}catch{return []}}),currentSection=computed(()=>parsedSections.value.find(s=>s.id===activeSection.value))
const testedBranches=computed(()=>guideFailureBranches.filter(branch=>branch.validation!=='pending actual branch evidence'&&branch.validation!=='not precisely bound').length)
const initial=ref(''),saved=ref(''),previewed=ref(''),previewOpen=ref(false),previewArticle=ref<GuideArticle>(),importOpen=ref(false),importText=ref(''),importError=ref(''),previewImportText=ref(''),importPreview=ref<ReturnType<typeof guide.previewImport>>()
const snapshot=computed(()=>JSON.stringify({form:form.value,sections:sectionsText.value,evidence:evidenceText.value,reviewed:reviewed.value})),dirty=computed(()=>!!form.value&&snapshot.value!==initial.value || importOpen.value&&!!importText.value)
const {confirmDiscard}=useRbacDraftGuard(dirty),filtered=computed(()=>guide.articles.filter(a=>`${a.title} ${a.id}`.toLowerCase().includes(search.value.toLowerCase()))),references=computed(()=>guideReferenceProblems())
const canSave=computed(()=>!busy.value&&catalog.can('system:guide:update')&&reconciled.value),canPublish=computed(()=>canSave.value&&!!guide.state.drafts[selected.value]&&snapshot.value===saved.value&&snapshot.value===previewed.value)
function load(id:string){const editable=guide.editable(id);if(!editable)return;selected.value=id;form.value=editable;activeSection.value=editable.sections[0]?.id||'';advanced.value=false;sectionsText.value=JSON.stringify(editable.sections,null,2);evidenceText.value=editable.evidence.join('\n');reviewed.value=false;error.value='';basis.value=guide.state.revision;reconciled.value=true;initial.value=snapshot.value;saved.value=guide.state.drafts[id]?snapshot.value:'';previewed.value=''}
async function select(id:string){if(id===selected.value)return;if(await confirmDiscard())load(id)}
watch(()=>route.query.article,id=>{if(typeof id==='string'&&guide.article(id))void select(id)},{immediate:true});if(!selected.value&&guide.articles[0])load(guide.articles[0].id)
function updateSection(field:'title'|'paragraphs'|'steps',value:string){if(!currentSection.value||currentSection.value.id==='conditions')return;const next=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(parsedSections.value)) as GuideSection[],section=next.find(s=>s.id===activeSection.value)!;if(field==='title')section.title=value;else section[field]=value.split('\n').filter(Boolean);sectionsText.value=JSON.stringify(next,null,2)}
function addSection(){const next=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(parsedSections.value)) as GuideSection[],id=`supplement-${Date.now()}`;next.push({id,title:'补充说明',paragraphs:[]});sectionsText.value=JSON.stringify(next,null,2);activeSection.value=id}
function removeSection(){if(!currentSection.value||currentSection.value.id==='conditions')return;const next=parsedSections.value.filter(s=>s.id!==activeSection.value);sectionsText.value=JSON.stringify(next,null,2);activeSection.value=next[0]?.id||''}
function candidate(){if(!form.value)throw Error('请先选择文章。');let sections:unknown;try{sections=JSON.parse(sectionsText.value)}catch{throw Error('章节 JSON 格式无效，请检查逗号、引号及数组结构。')};const value={...JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(form.value)),sections,evidence:evidenceText.value.split('\n').map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean),status:'review'} as GuideOverride;const issues=overrideProblems(value);if(issues.length)throw Error(issues.join(' '));return value}
async function saveDraft(){if(!canSave.value)return;busy.value=true;error.value='';try{const r=await guide.saveDraft(candidate(),basis.value);if(!r.ok){error.value=r.message||'草稿未保存';return}basis.value=guide.state.revision;initial.value=snapshot.value;saved.value=snapshot.value;ElMessage.success('草稿已保存，发布版未改变')}catch(e){error.value=e instanceof Error?e.message:String(e)}finally{busy.value=false}}
function preview(){error.value='';try{const value=candidate(),base=guide.article(selected.value)!;previewArticle.value={...base,...value,id:base.id,status:reviewed.value?'verified':'review'};previewed.value=snapshot.value;previewOpen.value=true}catch(e){error.value=e instanceof Error?e.message:String(e)}}
async function publish(){if(!canPublish.value)return;busy.value=true;error.value='';try{const r=await guide.publish(selected.value,basis.value,reviewed.value);if(!r.ok){error.value=r.message||'发布失败';return}load(selected.value);ElMessage.success('说明已发布，普通读者可查看新修订')}catch(e){error.value=String(e)}finally{busy.value=false}}
async function readLatest(){if(busy.value)return;guide.refresh();basis.value=guide.state.revision;reconciled.value=false;saved.value='';previewed.value='';error.value='';if(guide.contentError)error.value=guide.contentError}
async function restorePrevious(){if(!await confirmDiscard())return;try{await ElMessageBox.confirm('恢复最近一次发布说明？只改变指南内容，不修改业务规则与数据。','恢复发布说明')}catch{return}busy.value=true;error.value='';try{const r=await guide.restorePrevious(selected.value,basis.value);if(!r.ok){error.value=r.message||'恢复失败';return}load(selected.value);ElMessage.success('已恢复上一发布说明，形成新修订')}catch(e){error.value=String(e)}finally{busy.value=false}}
function download(text:string,name:string){const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([text],{type:'application/json;charset=utf-8'})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}
function exportBackup(){try{download(guide.exportBackup(),'erp-business-guide.json')}catch(e){error.value=String(e)}}
async function readImport(event:Event){const file=(event.target as HTMLInputElement).files?.[0];if(file){if(file.size>3_000_000){importError.value='指南备份过大';return}importText.value=await file.text();importPreview.value=undefined}}
function previewImport(){importError.value='';const result=guide.previewImport(importText.value);if(!result.ok){importPreview.value=undefined;importError.value=result.message||'校验失败';return}importPreview.value=result;previewImportText.value=importText.value}
async function confirmImport(){if(!importPreview.value||previewImportText.value!==importText.value||busy.value)return;busy.value=true;importError.value='';try{const r=await guide.importBackup(previewImportText.value,importPreview.value.revision!);if(!r.ok){importError.value=r.message||'导入失败';return}importText.value='';importOpen.value=false;importPreview.value=undefined;guide.refresh();basis.value=guide.state.revision;reconciled.value=false;saved.value='';previewed.value='';ElMessage.success('指南备份已导入，当前编辑输入保留，请核对')}catch(e){importError.value=String(e)}finally{busy.value=false}}
</script>
<style>
.guide-management-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:270px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;align-items:start}.guide-management-list{max-height:calc(100vh - 180px);overflow:auto;position:sticky;top:12px}.guide-management-list button{display:block;width:100%;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--el-border-color-lighter);background:none;color:var(--el-text-color-primary);text-align:left;padding:14px 8px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1.5;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.guide-management-list button[aria-current=true]{background:var(--el-color-primary-light-9);color:var(--el-color-primary)}.guide-management-list small{display:block;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-top:5px}.guide-management-editor{min-width:0}.guide-management-editor .el-alert{margin:12px 0}.guide-management-editor .el-form-item__label{font-weight:600}.guide-section-editor{width:100%}.guide-field-label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--text-secondary)}.guide-json textarea{font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px}.guide-coverage{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.guide-coverage summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}.guide-coverage li{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.guide-review-latest{padding:12px;background:var(--el-fill-color-light);font-size:13px;margin:12px 0}@media(max-width:1050px){.guide-management-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.guide-management-list{position:static;max-height:280px}}
</style>
